Package: fishtrophic
Title: Trophic Level, Growth and Nutrient Data for Freshwater Fish from FishBase
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Lorenzo", "Longobardi", , "l.longobardi@cgiar.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extracts native freshwater and brackish-water fish species
    for chosen countries from FishBase, with their trophic level, feeding
    guild, growth parameters, nutrient content and aquaculture use, and
    scores them with a simple nutritional index.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/WorldFishCenter/fishtrophic
BugReports: https://github.com/WorldFishCenter/fishtrophic/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    magrittr,
    purrr,
    rfishbase,
    rlang
Suggests:
    devtools,
    ggplot2,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    stringr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    wesanderson
Config/testthat/edition: 3
